<Slide
  style={{
    width: '1280px', height: '720px',
    background: '#F5F7FA',
    padding: '20px 60px',
    fontFamily: '"思源黑体", sans-serif',
  }}
>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2, marginBottom: 8 }}>ELEMENT 01 · ROLE</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#16263F', fontWeight: 'bold', marginBottom: 14 }}>要素①角色：给 AI 戴上职业帽子</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 4, background: '#22D3EE', marginBottom: 22 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 26, flex: 1, marginBottom: 42 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 6, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, padding: 16, justifyContent: 'center', boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)' }}>
        <Image
          src='assets/ai_role_playing.png'
          style={{ width: '100%', height: 340, objectFit: 'cover', borderRadius: 12, marginBottom: 16 }}
        />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F', marginBottom: 6 }}>同一个 AI，换上不同「职业帽子」</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>角色不是装饰，而是在指定知识视角、表达口吻与专业标准。</Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flex: 5, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        {[
          { t: '专业型', d: '「你是资深后端工程师」→ 输出更内行', icon: 'user-tie' },
          { t: '创意型', d: '「你是文案策划」→ 表达更有感染力', icon: 'palette' },
          { t: '中介型', d: '「你是翻译/谈判专家」→ 擅长双向转换', icon: 'handshake' },
        ].map((item, idx) => (
          <Box key={idx} style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 12, padding: '12px 14px', boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 34, height: 34, borderRadius: 10, background: '#EAF2FB', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
              <FAIcon name={item.icon} style={{ fill: '#22D3EE', width: 17, height: 17 }} />
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F', marginBottom: 2 }}>{item.t}</Text>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>{item.d}</Text>
            </Box>
          </Box>
        ))}

        <Box style={{ marginTop: 4, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 12, padding: '14px 16px', border: '1px solid rgba(255,159,28,0.35)', boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)' }}>
          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8, marginBottom: 6 }}>
            <FAIcon name='times-circle' style={{ fill: '#FF9F1C', width: 18, height: 18 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FF9F1C' }}>反面：没戴帽子</Text>
          </Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>「帮我写个活动方案」→ 模型不知道你是什么身份、要什么语气，输出泛泛而谈。</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ background: '#16263F', borderRadius: 12, padding: '14px 16px' }}>
          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8, marginBottom: 6 }}>
            <FAIcon name='check-circle' style={{ fill: '#22D3EE', width: 18, height: 18 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>正面：戴好帽子</Text>
          </Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>「你是一位有 5 年经验的线下活动策划，帮我写一份面向 30 人技术分享会的活动方案」→ 输出更有针对性。</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 14, left: 60, right: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>AI 从零开始 · 第 3 讲</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>03 / 11</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
